[I] MP4 and MOV muxer/demuxer

[T] L-SMASH (Loyal to Spec of Mpeg4 and Ad-hoc Simple Hackwork) is a library
[T] and set of command line tools for muxing, demuxing and remuxing ISO base
[T] media files such as MP4 and QuickTime MOV, with a strong focus on
[T] specification compliance.

[U] https://github.com/l-smash/l-smash

[A] Lsmash Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 2.18.0
[L] ISC

[D] 9667ab1829c879a813c0cd9b51690c87e131c0d1a4aac76050bfda93 lsmash-2.18.0.tar.gz https://github.com/vimeo/l-smash/archive/v2.18.0/

var_append confopt ' ' "--cc=$CC"
atstage cross && var_remove_regex makeopt ' ' 'LD=.*'
